# Welcome to Waraki

If you have music files stored on this device that you would like to play here, and host for playing elsewhere, you can set up a music library by telling Waraki where your music files are.
[set up new music library]({id="setupButton", color = vec4(0.4,0.7,1.0,1.0)})

If you have already set up a music library, you can connect to it
[connect to music library]({id="connectButton", color = vec4(0.4,0.7,1.0,1.0)})